  "contentHtml": "<p>대학들이 학생선발시</p><p>&#39;전공 적합성 평가&#39;에서 &#39;학업탐구역량 평가&#39;를 한다고 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d79683f04748a7d63d7bfd0191e908c33d9b0413\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d79683f04748a7d63d7bfd0191e908c33d9b0413\" data-origin-width=\"708\" data-origin-height=\"596\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92d6849441689c38937ad7419eaa3a499612172a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92d6849441689c38937ad7419eaa3a499612172a\" data-origin-width=\"600\" data-origin-height=\"165\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">아래는 서울 소재 5개 대학의 &#39;학업능력&#39;의 평가 항목입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3cf110fca08259035fc8a278fcadcf3b131df447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3cf110fca08259035fc8a278fcadcf3b131df447\" data-origin-width=\"713\" data-origin-height=\"591\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>이런 자료를 기반으로 챗GPT와 대화를 나누었습니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc049ebcdad8ae8a7cea6aca0bb84fc2812e0e88\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc049ebcdad8ae8a7cea6aca0bb84fc2812e0e88\" data-origin-width=\"802\" data-origin-height=\"694\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ee16d7bd770ee4632ae827b965781ba82e1777a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ee16d7bd770ee4632ae827b965781ba82e1777a\" data-origin-width=\"793\" data-origin-height=\"590\"></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 87.7987%; height: 171px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afd5215d24d41e33733813ec7303265cc4b925ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afd5215d24d41e33733813ec7303265cc4b925ef\" data-origin-width=\"665\" data-origin-height=\"108\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>-----------------------------------------------</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/062cc59e6df915a923cd73c596283f2e8b4f56a8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/062cc59e6df915a923cd73c596283f2e8b4f56a8\" data-origin-width=\"554\" data-origin-height=\"70\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ed523156ca4a4c51eb6715a9ff147b86cc0ce2a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ed523156ca4a4c51eb6715a9ff147b86cc0ce2a\" data-origin-width=\"581\" data-origin-height=\"230\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da80e1a42d08089f055ffb6dd2eda6a4d409