aBA/00d53ffacd10eb7fa2a3021729170f13685477f6\" data-origin-width=\"785\" data-origin-height=\"513\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cc9fa43947d04e79b7302f535d58bbce1037015\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cc9fa43947d04e79b7302f535d58bbce1037015\" data-origin-width=\"670\" data-origin-height=\"160\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce478204321a6da9cb17f00a013cd64e1947d7d3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"655\" height=\"371\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce478204321a6da9cb17f00a013cd64e1947d7d3\" data-origin-width=\"1163\" data-origin-height=\"658\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>----------------------------------------</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>그럼 학업역량의 강조가&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>단순히 대입진학의 목적을 넘어서</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>앞으로 인생을 살아가는데 어떤 도움이 될까요?</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3af4eb93f87c2c1383e51c4bda550179442234f4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"680\" height=\"234\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3af4eb93f87c2c1383e51c4bda550179442234f4\" data-origin-width=\"787\" data-origin-height=\"271\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85734279af1b1b8f1b0a6e4577ecf8f73240ba11\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85734279af1b1b8f1b0a6e4577ecf8f73240ba11\" data-origin-width=\"609\" data-origin-height=\"341\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b50c54dfd2f2314ddbeaade65d3240736c0ccd6f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"708\" height=\"227\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b50c54dfd2f2314ddbeaade65d3240736c0ccd6f\" data-origin-width=\"801\" data-origin-height=\"257\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7bf70f61e5e71c95cb432e2e49139467c566601\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"702\" height=\"399\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7bf70f61e5e71c95cb432e2e49139467c566601\" data-origin-width=\"813\" data-origin-height=\"462\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4a9aee28b0b4cd1961df5bec43cefecf175ca8e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"680\" height=\"301\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4a9aee28b0b4cd1961df5bec43cefecf175ca8e\" data-origin-width=\"806\" data-origin-height=\"357\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c274a1e48101fc72c0a2cbc75c21be062971afd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"704\" height=\"473\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c274a1e48101fc72c0a2cbc75c21be062971afd\" data-origin-width=\"778\" data-origin-height=\"523\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>헤어디자이너가 되고 싶다면, </b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;손기술 연습만 할 것이 아니라,</b></span><br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;그 기술을 설계하고 설명하며 발전시킬 수 있는 학업역량을 함께 기르자.</b></span><br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#160;그래야 직업이 되고, 결국 자신만의 브랜드가 된다. </b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>-----------------------------------------------------</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/439b057b77f46fdf216876898d21930f1c9137b2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"645\" height=\"515\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/439b057b77f46fdf216876898d21930f1c9137b2\" data-origin-width=\"810\" data-origin-height=\"647\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e86ff128496ccbb378bfc7ca42cdc0f1a9b6986\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"676\" height=\"243\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e86ff128496ccbb378bfc7ca42cdc0f1a9b6986\" data-origin-width=\"782\" data-origin-height=\"281\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5afba1ed4366a7a6a4af227e23d1af33346633b5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"646\" height=\"620\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5afba1ed4366a7a6a4af227e23d1af33346633b5\" data-origin-width=\"785\" data-origin-height=\"753\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7dc18a2ea4f13f736de26930730d1877cf35402\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d7dc18a2ea4f13f736de26930730d1877cf35402\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"687\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
